{"identity_key": "bilibili:1271245688965955606", "source_id": "bilibili", "item_id": "1271245688965955606", "content": "#She is Legend# 新歌《ネガティブなマシンガンで撃ち抜け（用悲观机关枪射穿吧）》已伴随樱庭星罗的新剧情活动《Twinkle, twinkle, Crystal Ball》正式上线！\n\n#XAI# 说： \n虽说人生是连续的选择，\n对自己来说把那个被选择的成为“正解”是非常重要的。\n可能哪一个都不是“正确的”……但这是胜利！\n愿自己不要忘记这份She is Legend的心态\n\n#铃木木乃美# 说： \n与其说……是被歌词推着走，\n不如说是“借这份力量向前向前推着走”，\n的感觉来演唱的！\nShe is Legend永远有炽热的心，全力奔跑🏃\n\n#HEAVEN BURNS RED# #绯染天空# #炽焰天穹# #红烧天堂# \n#麻枝准# #Key社# \n\n翻译：@林檎果officialCN  \n\nhttps://x.com/SiL_official_jp/status/2122170292860842220", "publisher": "StuartRiki_鍵視", "canonical_url": "https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1271245688965955606", "published_at": "2026-11-16T10:02:32+00:00", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-16T15:29:35.237186+00:00", "media": [{"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/73cee99956156e5ddbc12dd6e0f39e4339471072.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/8227f807c107bcd0f85b2ff2c0c1c74639471072.png"}, {"type": "image", "url": "http://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/new_dyn/6b6ad5a2c76ff6afe773c1bbaf79557939471072.jpg"}], "metadata": {"account": "bili_39471072", "uid": "39471072", "dynamic_type": "DYNAMIC_TYPE_DRAW", "title": "", "is_retweet": false, "is_reply": false, "is_quote": false, "stats": {"likes": 151, "retweets": 1, "replies": 2}, "provider": "web-dynamic/feed-space", "route": "anonymous-buvid", "tag": "B站Gal"}}
